# Example requests. Open in VS Code with the "REST Client" extension and click "Send Request".
# Or use the interactive Swagger UI at http://localhost:8080/docs
@base = http://localhost:8080
@token = change-me-local-fault-token

### Service description
GET {{base}}/

### Liveness (process up)
GET {{base}}/health/live

### Readiness (dependencies)
GET {{base}}/health/ready

### Version / deployment info
GET {{base}}/info

### Create an order
# @name created
POST {{base}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: demo-request-0001

{
  "customer_id": "cust-001",
  "currency": "USD",
  "items": [
    { "sku": "WIDGET-1", "quantity": 2, "unit_price_cents": 1250 },
    { "sku": "GADGET-2", "quantity": 1, "unit_price_cents": 4999 }
  ]
}

### Get the order just created
GET {{base}}/api/v1/orders/{{created.response.body.id}}

### Check out (pay) the order
POST {{base}}/api/v1/orders/{{created.response.body.id}}/checkout

### List recent orders
GET {{base}}/api/v1/orders?limit=10

### Business stats
GET {{base}}/api/v1/stats

### --- Fault injection (demo only) ---------------------------------------------

### List faults
GET {{base}}/admin/faults
X-Fault-Token: {{token}}

### Enable latency
PUT {{base}}/admin/faults/latency
X-Fault-Token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "params": { "delay_ms": 1500 } }

### Reset all faults (recovery)
DELETE {{base}}/admin/faults
X-Fault-Token: {{token}}
